src/autoacoustics/analysis/_loudness_engine.py contains filter tables and
nonlinear/temporal recurrences adapted from MoSQITo 1.2.1, by Eomys and
contributors, licensed under Apache License 2.0. The modifications provide
bounded storage, chunked iteration and persistent filter/temporal states.
The loudness model is unchanged; core loudness and Bark integration call
upstream MoSQITo functions. See licenses/source/Apache-2.0.mosqito.txt.
Upstream: https://github.com/Eomys/MoSQITo/tree/v1.2.1

Synthetic fixtures in tests/fixtures/imports are generated by the included
generate.py script. They are not customer recordings or independent ISO
reference measurements.

